  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Paint the Town</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4472 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news tag-paint-the-town tag-plein-air\" id=\"post-4472\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-success/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"381\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A red, white, and blue American flag waving proudly in a garden near a marina, showcasing the patriotic spirit of The Guild of Harwich Artists.\" src=\"/media/archive/55535c2e33d89a679a55d0ae9593d883e0eec49b0242988dc5fd84d565cf7c59.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-success/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Annual Paint the Town Success</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-18T22:21:15-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 18, 2019, 10:21 pm\">June 18, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists gathered at Saquatucket Municipal Marina in Harwich Port last Saturday as part of their annual ‘Paint the Town.’  On a sunny June day, Guild artists, painting en plein air, spread out along the newly constructed harbormaster complex and Dockside Seafood Shack overlooking the boat-filled marina.  Starting early in the morning and running through mid-afternoon, about a dozen artists captured the moods in the changing tide and light.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3820 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wet-sale tag-wychmere-harbor\" id=\"post-3820\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Annual Paint The Town, Saturday June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-12T01:53:26-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 12, 2018, 1:53 am\">June 12, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Annual “Paint The Town” en plein air event will be held Saturday, June 16 from 9:00 am – noon. Watch for Guild of Harwich Artists in the following locations: Harwich <a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3349 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-harwich-conservation-trust tag-paint-the-town tag-sacrifice-art-sale tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3349\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/nominating-committee-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Nominating Committee News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-09-14T01:46:27-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 14, 2017, 1:46 am\">September 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>For Art and The Community Want to be more involved with The Guild of Harwich Artists and your community? Join us this nominating year (2018-2020) by filling some of the <a href=\"/news/nominating-committee-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2823 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wychmere-harbor\" id=\"post-2823\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/paint-the-town-2017-wychmere-harbor/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"432\" alt=\"A man is painting on a lawn near a body of water.\" src=\"/media/archive/2f1dcd3f14f25b07d857744321709a0911fb61ce8be5fcbf81fa008c16eb2165.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/paint-the-town-2017-wychmere-harbor/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Paint the Town 2017, Wychmere Harbor</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-06-14T19:43:30-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, June 14, 2017, 7:43 pm\">June 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Members of the Guild of Harwich Artists will celebrate their annual “Paint the Town” event at Wychmere Harbor this year. Saturday, June 17, members will be painting from the overlook <a href=\"/news/paint-the-town-2017-wychmere-harbor/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
